What:		/proc/oplus_mem/fragmentation_index
Date:		September 2026
Contact:	Miru H.40 kernel maintainers
Description:
		Android 14 OnePlus 9R proactive-compaction telemetry ABI.
		Reading returns three decimal values: whether node 0 is considered
		fragmented, the huge-page order used for scoring, and the scoring
		proactiveness.  The accepted writes are:

		  compaction_hpage_order=<0..200>
		  compaction_proactiveness=<0..200>

		The interface changes only these scoring values and does not start
		compaction.  Miru Wave 32 restores the built-in 9R implementation;
		older Miru documentation listed this ABI before it existed at runtime.

What:		/proc/storage/buf_log
Date:		September 2026
Contact:	Miru H.40 kernel maintainers
Description:
		Android 14 OnePlus 9R bounded storage diagnostic log.  Reads return
		the current buffer.  Writes append a timestamped entry of at most
		1024 bytes.  Writing "clear storage log" resets the buffer to its
		header.  The buffer is limited to 1 MiB and does not modify storage
		I/O behavior.
